	(text "Pilot: vehicle-side state resistors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 43.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5781d3e4-060f-573c-9c4b-0c1cb680c0e8")
	)
	(text "Car-side pilot.  CP -> diode -> 2.74k to GND (state B, always) ; 1.3k via K1 to GND (state C).\nK1 = CPC1117N, form-B (CLOSED when unpowered): a dead board presents state C, so the EVSE delivers\nAC and Pin-B wakes the truck.  CP_S2_OPEN high = LED on = K1 open = state B (pause / stop).\nCP read: 200k / 45.3k to 3V3 / 57.6k to GND maps CP -12..+12 V to 0.3..3.0 V (CP 0 V = 1.65 V),\nload on CP >= 200k.  TLV3201 vs 1.65 V, 1M hysteresis (~0.7 V at CP) -> CP_DUTY (MCPWM capture).\nCP_SENSE -> 1k/1nF -> CP_LVL -> ESP32 ADC1 IO1: +12 / +9 / +6 V = 3.0 / 2.66 / 2.33 V (state A / B / C).\nPP: this board owns PP (Zombie interface=CPC, plug state in 0x357).  4.7k pull-up to 3V3:\nopen 3.3 V (ADC full scale), plug 150R ~0.10 V, latch pressed (150R+330R) ~0.31 V -> ESP32 ADC1 IO2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7eede2bf-e03c-5ef8-9ced-a6bde098154c")
	)
	(text "PP read"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 160.02 0)
		(effects
